# C-22: level-build interrupts for CLIMB to levels 1-4 (harness-modified).
# Pokes place the player on a vertical
# feature from VFTTAB (COMCRE.ASM:184) before each CLIMB; one pokes LEVEL
# so PCLIMB's ADDA LEVEL builds level 3, which no ladder or hole reaches.
# L0 hole (15,4) -> L1; L1 hole (3,31) -> L2; L2 ladder (2,3) -> L1;
# L1 hole (19,20) with LEVEL=2 -> L3; L3 hole (0,31) -> L4.
# Run with DOD_JIFFIES=3600 and
# DOD_POKE=5:PPOW:0x7000,5:PDAM:0,50:PROW:0x0F04,700:PDAM:0,750:PROW:0x031F,1400:PDAM:0,1450:PROW:0x0203,2100:PDAM:0,2150:PROW:0x1314,2150:LEVEL:2:1,2800:PDAM:0,2850:PROW:0x001F
# (PROW is written as two bytes, PROW then PCOL.)
60 C
61 SPACE
62 D
63 CR
760 C
761 SPACE
762 D
763 CR
1460 C
1461 SPACE
1462 U
1463 CR
2160 C
2161 SPACE
2162 D
2163 CR
2860 C
2861 SPACE
2862 D
2863 CR
